e one where users could post on social media, order clothes online, and play mobile games without a care in the world. As time progressed, companies eventually realized that they could collect small pieces of information from a user\u2019s technological habits, and use that to form a profile of the user of some sort. I used a packet-monitoring service to listen in on third-party applications and wrote a script to filter out relevant pieces of data that were being sent back to an application\u2019s server. The findings of this study concluded that third-party iOS applications have unmonitored power to access pieces of information like contacts, location, and emails.","topics":[],"score":181213,"global_rank":403807},{"name":"LucasL53/ios_homekit","owner":"LucasL53","html_url":"https://github.com/LucasL53/ios_homekit","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181213,"global_rank":403808},{"name":"sagemathinc/learn","owner":"sagemathinc","html_url":"https://github.com/sagemathinc/learn","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":3,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":181211,"global_rank":403809},{"name":"fpruitt/resume","owner":"fpruitt","html_url":"https://github.com/fpruitt/resume","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"TeX","description":"Current version of my Resume","topics":[],"score":181211,"global_rank":403814},{"name":"DouglasUrner/Meteor-TDD","owner":"DouglasUrner","html_url":"https://github.com/DouglasUrner/Meteor-TDD","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Experiments as I teach myself TDD in Meteor.","topics":[],"score":181210,"global_rank":403815},{"name":"stevengum/arm-templates-for-samples","owner":"stevengum","html_url":"https://github.com/stevengum/arm-templates-for-samples","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"For soliciting feedback on ARM templates","topics":[],"score":181210